# =============================================================================
# Rust / Cargo Build Artifacts
# =============================================================================
target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock is intentionally TRACKED: every workspace member must keep a fresh
# lockfile (`outfeed lockfiles .` is the gate). Never add it here.

# =============================================================================
# Embedded Databases & Machine State (derived, rebuilt on demand)
# =============================================================================
*.redb
*.redb.lock
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# =============================================================================
# gaugeblock Suite State
# =============================================================================
# Canonical project state is TRACKED and shared across machines:
#   .gaugeblock/config.toml
#   .gaugeblock/docs.toml            (once adopted)
#   .gaugeblock/miter/*.toml         (allowlists are gate inputs, not machine state)
#   .gaugeblock/storypole/ledger.jsonl
#   .gaugeblock/storypole/plans/
# Everything below is per-machine output. An exception that lives on one machine
# is a gate nobody else can reproduce.
.gaugeblock/spool/
.gaugeblock/worktrees/
.gaugeblock/datasets/
.gaugeblock/chat/
.gaugeblock/.env
.gaugeblock/**/*.sqlite
.gaugeblock/**/*.sqlite-wal
.gaugeblock/**/*.sqlite-shm
.gaugeblock/miter/*
!.gaugeblock/miter/*.toml

# Legacy pre-`.gaugeblock/` tool directories, ignored so a stray invocation from
# the repo root cannot commit them.
.storypole/index.sqlite*
.miter/
**/.miter/
.dado/

# =============================================================================
# Benchmarks, Profiling & Coverage
# =============================================================================
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph.svg
lcov.info
tarpaulin-report.html
critcmp.json

# =============================================================================
# Capture Corpora
# =============================================================================
# Raw IQ / Beast recordings are large and not reproducible. Small, reviewed
# fixtures belong in tests/vectors/; bulk captures stay local.
/captures/
*.cu8
*.sc16
*.iq

# =============================================================================
# Environment & Secrets
# =============================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# =============================================================================
# Editors, OS & Agent Ephemera
# =============================================================================
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.cline/
.cursor/
*.code-workspace
!aerofoil.code-workspace
agent_scratchpad.md
agent_todo.md
*.log
